Error [E0204]: `index` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> dynamic_projection_operands_are_checked_but_not_retained.jet:6:25
    |
  6 |     both(&index, values[index])
    |                         ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&index`) only once, or copy first with `~index`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
